<title>USA: Dixon PFA, Calif., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Dixon PFA, Calif., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc., said it won $3.300 million of Dixon Public Financing Authority, Calif., 1997 lease revenue bonds,  with a true interest cost of 5.415 percent.</p>
</text>
